## API Integration Points

| Feature | Flue API Endpoint | Method |
|---------|-------------------|--------|
| List agents | `/admin/agents` | GET |
| Get agent runs | `/admin/runs?workflow=<name>` | GET |
| Get run detail | `/admin/runs/:runId` | GET |
| Invoke workflow | `/workflows/:name` | POST |
| Agent chat | `/agents/:name/:id` | POST |
| Agent events | `/agents/:name/:id` | GET (SSE) |
| Discord channel | `/channels/discord/interactions` | POST |
| Resend channel | `/channels/resend/webhook` | POST |

