## Vercel Deployment

The `agent/` directory is configured as a standalone Vercel project:
- `vercel.json` sets up the rewrite to proxy `/api/flue/*` requests to the main site
- Environment variables reference the main site's Flue API
- Can be deployed independently with `vercel --cwd agent`

Alternatively, it can be deployed as a path-based route on the main site by adding it to the existing Next.js app under `app/agent/`.
